<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Feb2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Feb2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 500 million marks by joint lead managers BZW, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    01.FEB.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    14 BP     SELL CONC  18.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT JAN 2006 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 483</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON  **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
